|---|---|---|---|
| **Verdict accuracy (primary)** | 4/10 (40%) | 10/10 (100%) | +60 pts |
| **Trap packages caught** | 2/3 | 3/3 | +1 |
| Evidence-backed claims | 0 of 0 (no artifacts produced) | 60 of 60 (100% cited) | +60 verifiable |
